00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:20,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There were no students
as exceptional as that boy.</font>

135
00:08:21,730 --> 00:08:23,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a bit too much praise.</font>

136
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:24,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not at all...</font>

137
00:08:25,310 --> 00:08:27,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm hopeful for you, too.</font>

138
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:31,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Become a fine Shinobi
like your big brother.</font>

139
00:08:33,820 --> 00:08:34,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

140
00:08:40,580 --> 00:08:42,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... That's Uchiha, right?</font>

141
00:08:43,660 --> 00:08:44,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

142
00:08:44,790 --> 00:08:46,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder... if he's awesome, too.</font>

143
00:08:47,210 --> 00:08:49,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm... Must be.</font>

144
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:56,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Recess at last! What a drag.
I'm still not used to this place...</font>

145
00:08:57,010 --> 00:08:58,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You want some too, Shikamaru?</font>

146
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:02,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean, all of your recesses
have become meal times.</font>

147
00:09:20,700 --> 00:09:22,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my boy...</font>

148
00:09:22,830 --> 00:09:25,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've great confidence
you'll make it great in ANBU.</font>

149
00:09:33,300 --> 00:09:34,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This won't do!</font>

150
00:09:35,260 --> 00:09:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Won't do!</font>

151
00:09:49,110 --> 00:09:50,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got a long way... to go...</font>

152
00:09:54,150 --> 00:09:55,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really...</font>

153
00:09:55,780 --> 00:09:59,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should rest your body
on your days off at least.</font>

154
00:10:00,870 --> 00:10:02,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't have to push it.</font>

155
00:10:03,290 --> 00:10:07,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard... that nii-san graduated
from the Academy in just one year.</font>

156
00:10:08,460 --> 00:10:11,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The times are different, then and now.</font>

157
00:10:11,420 --> 00:10:15,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, that kid is a bit special, so...</font>

158
00:10:18,010 --> 00:10:19,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my boy...</font>

159
00:10:27,270 --> 00:10:30,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, I'm going to hand out
the report cards for the first half.</font>

160
00:10:35,570 --> 00:10:37,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"Taijutsu: 1st in class and academy"
"Ninjutsu: 1st in class and academy"</b></font>

161
00:10:43,490 --> 00:10:46,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do a fine job in this vein like
your big brother.</font>

162
00:10:57,550 --> 00:11:03,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father... I wanted you to say,
"That's my boy," to me...</font>

163
00:11:07,270 --> 00:11:08,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?</font>

164
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:11,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean you can't participate
in the assembly tomorrow?!</font>

165
00:11:13,060 --> 00:11:15,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't understand your own position!</font>

166
00:11:19,070 --> 00:11:20,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm setting out on a mission tomorrow.</font>

167
00:11:21,740 --> 00:11:24,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're they doing this late
at night with the lights off?</font>

168
00:11:25,450 --> 00:11:26,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What mission?!</font>

169
00:11:28,330 --> 00:11:31,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't say...
It's a top secret mission.</font>

170
00:11:38,260 --> 00:11:42,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Itachi... You also have the role
of the pipe which connects the clan</font>

171
00:11:42,470 --> 00:11:44,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the keystone of the village.</font>

172
00:11:45,550 --> 00:11:47,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know that, don't you?</font>

173
00:11:47,970 --> 00:11:48,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

174
00:11:49,640 --> 00:11:54,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Keep that well in mind!
And come to tomorrow's assembly!</font>

175
00:11:58,900 --> 00:11:59,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...</font>

176
00:12:01,650 --> 00:12:03,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get to bed after
you've gone to the bathroom.</font>

177
00:12:05,030 --> 00:12:05,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right...</font>

178
00:12:06,530 --> 00:12:08,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing hanging around
this late at night?</font>

179
00:12:09,250 --> 00:12:10,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get to bed!</font>

180
00:12:11,040 --> 00:12:11,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

181
00:12:19,050 --> 00:12:20,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"Report Card"</b></font>

182
00:12:22,470 --> 00:12:24,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father only thinks about you, nii-san...</font>

183
00:12:27,220 --> 00:12:28,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Am I loathsome to you?</font>

184
00:12:31,770 --> 00:12:33,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay.</font>

185
00:12:33,690 --> 00:12:38,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's logical for Shinobi to be
ill-thought of by people, so...</font>

186
00:12:38,820 --> 00:12:40,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not how I feel...</font>

187
00:12:42,700 --> 00:12:48,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-san's right.
I really do... think ill of him...</font>

188
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:53,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excellence is not easy at all.</font>

189
00:12:54,160 --> 00:12:57,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you have power,
you become alienated and also arrogant.</font>

190
00:12:58,420 --> 00:13:01,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you're coveted
and sought after at first.</font>

191
00:13:02,630 --> 00:13:05,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, we only have each other
for siblings.</font>

192
00:13:06,510 --> 00:13:11,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will continue to exist with you
as a wall you must get over...</font>

193
00:13:12,810 --> 00:13:17,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I'm ill-thought of...
That's what a big brother is.</font>

194
00:13:17,900 --> 00:13:19,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is Itachi home?!</font>

195
00:13:19,650 --> 00:13:21,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have something to
talk to you about. Come out!</font>

196
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:28,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why's everyone gathered here?</font>

197
00:13:29,160 --> 00:13:32,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are two people who didn't come
to yesterday's assembly.</font>

198
00:13:32,830 --> 00:13:34,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why didn't you come?!</font>

199
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:41,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He didn't go to the assembly Father
was talking about last night, after all.</font>

200
00:13:41,710 --> 00:13:43,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand that when you enter ANBU,</font>

201
00:13:43,380 --> 00:13:46,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you get roped into various
troublesome things.</font>

202
00:13:47,180 --> 00:13:50,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your father also said something
like that in your defense.</font>

203
00:13:51,390 --> 00:13:55,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But for us, we don't intend
to treat you special.</font>

204
00:13:56,850 --> 00:13:59,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Understood. I shall be careful next time.</font>

205
00:14:00,770 --> 00:14:02,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now I'm going to have
to ask you to leave.</font>

206
00:14:02,980 --> 00:14:08,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right... But before that,
there's a little more I want to ask you...</font>

207
00:14:10,530 --> 00:14:16,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about Uchiha Shisui who threw himself
into the Nakano River to kill himself.</font>

208
00:14:17,040 --> 00:14:18,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Threw himself?!</font>

209
00:14:18,870 --> 00:14:22,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The other person who didn't come
to the assembly is that Shisui.</font>

210
00:14:22,800 --> 00:14:27,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I recall, you adored him
like a real older brother.</font>

211
00:14:29,680 --> 00:14:33,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... I hadn't seen him at all recently.</font>

212
00:14:34,970 --> 00:14:36,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's too bad.</font>

213
00:14:40,810 --> 00:14:46,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And we the Police Force have decided
to launch an all-out investigation.</font>

214
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:48,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Investigation?!</font>

215
00:14:50,530 --> 00:14:52,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the will Shisui wrote.</font>

216
00:14:53,030 --> 00:14:55,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The analysis of the handwriting
has been completed.</font>

217
00:14:55,830 --> 00:14:57,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No mistake, he did indeed write it.</font>

218
00:14:58,830 --> 00:15:01,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If there are no murder leads,
then what's the investigation?</font>

219
00:15:02,380 --> 00:15:07,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'd be easy for a person who can use
Sharingan to copy handwriting, you see...</font>

220
00:15:10,930 --> 00:15:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The most adept Uchiha.</font>

221
00:15:12,930 --> 00:15:15,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The man feared as Shisui,
"the Instantaneous Man."</font>

222
00:15:15,970 --> 00:15:18,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was a man who would take
the lead no matter what the mission</font>

223
00:15:19,060 --> 00:15:20,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if it was for the sake of the clan.</font>

224
00:15:21,060 --> 00:15:22,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's tough to think that</font>

225
00:15:22,520 --> 00:15:25,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">such a man would leave something
like this and kill himself.</font>

226
00:15:26,150 --> 00:15:30,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You shouldn't judge people...
only on looks and speculation.</font>

227
00:15:31,530 --> 00:15:34,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the time being,
I leave the will with you.</font>

228
00:15:34,990 --> 00:15:39,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take that and you request cooperation
in the investigation from ANBU Black Ops.</font>

229
00:15:40,250 --> 00:15:41,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Understood...</font>

230
00:15:44,330 --> 00:15:46,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hope we get a lead.</font>

231
00:15:46,750 --> 00:15:50,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also, we have a different route
to ANBU Black Ops.</font>

232
00:15:51,380 --> 00:15:55,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll know right away if you do something
like crushing the investigation request.</font>

233
00:15:58,680 --> 00:16:01,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you just come right out
and say it?</font>

234
00:16:03,730 --> 00:16:06,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You suspect me, right?</font>

235
00:16:06,900 --> 00:16:09,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. That's right, you little punk...</font>

236
00:16:09,690 --> 00:16:11,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen up, Itachi.</font>

237
00:16:11,610 --> 00:16:14,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just try doing something
like betraying the clan and...</font>

238
00:16:14,360 --> 00:16:16,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it'll cost you!</font>

239
00:16:25,500 --> 00:16:27,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you before.</font>

240
00:16:27,880 --> 00:16:31,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You shouldn't judge people...
only on looks and speculation.</font>

241
00:16:32,510 --> 00:16:36,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because you take the liberty to
judge me as patient and take me lightly.</font>

242
00:16:37,010 --> 00:16:39,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Clan... Clan...</font>

243
00:16:39,770 --> 00:16:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You measure incorrectly
the size of your own vessels</font>

244
00:16:43,640 --> 00:16:48,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and don't know the depth of mine,
so you grovel there...</font>

245
00:16:49,150 --> 00:16:51,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never seen him like this...</font>

246
00:16:52,610 --> 00:16:56,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shisui... was monitoring you recently...</font>

247
00:16:57,870 --> 00:17:00,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Half a year after entering ANBU...</font>

248
00:17:00,410 --> 00:17:04,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the strangeness of your behavior
couldn't be overlooked.</font>

249
00:17:05,250 --> 00:17:07,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell are you thinking?</font>

250
00:17:08,630 --> 00:17:09,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fixated on the organization,</font>

251
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:13,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">fixated on the clan,
fixated on the name.</font>

252
00:17:13,800 --> 00:17:18,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a dreadful thing that constrains
oneself and labels one's own vessel.</font>

253
00:17:19,510 --> 00:17:21,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it's a foolish thing...</font>

254
00:17:21,220 --> 00:17:25,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that fear and hate...
what one has never seen or known...</font>

255
00:17:25,100 --> 00:17:26,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop, Itachi!</font>

256
00:17:27,730 --> 00:17:29,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell's the matter
with you?!</font>

257
00:17:29,980 --> 00:17:32,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Itachi...
You've been a little strange lately.</font>

258
00:17:35,200 --> 00:17:36,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not strange at all.</font>

259
00:17:37,700 --> 00:17:41,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm carrying out my own role...
That's it.</font>

260
00:17:41,830 --> 00:17:44,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then why didn't you come last night?</font>

261
00:17:46,710 --> 00:17:48,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to elevate myself higher...</font>

262
00:17:49,880 --> 00:17:50,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you talking about...?</font>

263
00:18:00,760 --> 00:18:05,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My vessel is dismayed
at this foolish clan!</font>

264
00:18:07,230 --> 00:18:09,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From olden times,
the Uchiha Clan has all along</font>

265
00:18:09,400 --> 00:18:12,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">been in charge protecting
the peace of this village.</font>

266
00:18:13,030 --> 00:18:17,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Uchiha crest is a testament
to the proud clan.</font>

267
00:18:18,910 --> 00:18:20,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my boy...</font>

268
00:18:21,030 --> 00:18:24,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've great confidence
you'll do great in ANBU Black Ops.</font>

269
00:18:24,620 --> 00:18:28,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because you're fixated
on insignificant things like clans...</font>

270
00:18:28,460 --> 00:18:31,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you lose sight of what's truly important.</font>

271
00:18:31,790 --> 00:18:35,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">True change cannot be made if stuck
within the restrictions of regulations,</font>

272
00:18:35,380 --> 00:18:38,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and constrained predictions
and imagination...</font>

273
00:18:38,930 --> 00:18:40,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Saying such arrogant things!</font>

274
00:18:40,300 --> 00:18:45,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enough! You'll be imprisoned
if you say any more foolish nonsense.</font>

275
00:18:48,690 --> 00:18:50,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excellence is not easy at all.</font>

276
00:18:51,810 --> 00:18:55,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you have power,
you become alienated and also arrogant...</font>

277
00:18:55,900 --> 00:18:59,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even if you're coveted
and sought after at first...</font>

278
00:19:00,410 --> 00:19:02,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why... Nii-san...?</font>

279
00:19:03,780 --> 00:19:05,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you say?!</font>

280
00:19:05,830 --> 00:19:10,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't tolerate it anymore...
Captain, order imprisonment!</font>

281
00:19:10,460 --> 00:19:12,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-san! Stop it already!</font>

282
00:19:22,430 --> 00:19:24,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not the one who killed Shisui.</font>

283
00:19:25,640 --> 00:19:28,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I apologize for
my numerous slips of the tongue.</font>

284
00:19:29,430 --> 00:19:30,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm very sorry...</font>

285
00:19:35,480 --> 00:19:38,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Recently, it seems he's been up
to his ears in ANBU Black Ops missions</font>

286
00:19:38,690 --> 00:19:40,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and was a little tired...</font>

287
00:19:40,700 --> 00:19:41,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Captain!</font>

288
00:19:42,910 --> 00:19:45,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The ANBU Black Ops is a force
under the direct control of Hokage-sama...</font>

289
00:19:45,740 --> 00:19:50,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even we the Police Force can't arrest him,
if we don't have an arrest warrant.</font>

290
00:19:52,290 --> 00:19:53,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And as for Itachi...</font>

291
00:19:54,840 --> 00:19:57,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will take the responsibility
and monitor him.</font>

292
00:19:58,800 --> 00:19:59,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please...</font>

293
00:20:04,640 --> 00:20:05,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Understood...</font>

294
00:20:36,330 --> 00:20:39,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this, you've woken up, right?</font>

295
00:20:43,760 --> 00:20:45,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We had a hindrance back at that time...</font>

296
00:20:48,640 --> 00:20:50,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it won't be like that this time.</font>

297
00:20:53,690 --> 00:20:58,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll show you...
the true power of Sharingan.</font>

298
00:21:12,120 --> 00:21:16,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitotsu hitotsu omoidaseba</font></font></font></font>

299
00:21:12,120 --> 00:21:16,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">when I recalled the parts one by one,</font></font></font></font>

300
00:21:16,890 --> 00:21:23,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">subete wakatteita kigashite ita no ni</font></font></font></font>

301
00:21:16,890 --> 00:21:23,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I felt as though I had understood everything</font></font></font></font>

302
00:21:23,290 --> 00:21:27,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">iroaseta kotoba wa</font></font></font></font>

303
00:21:23,290 --> 00:21:27,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">faded words</font></font></font></font>

304
00:21:27,700 --> 00:21:34,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">boku no sugu soba ni oite atta</font></font></font></font>

305
00:21:27,700 --> 00:21:34,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">which I kept so close to me</font></font></font></font>

306
00:21:34,070 --> 00:21:38,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kotae no denai yoru to</font></font></font></font>

307
00:21:34,070 --> 00:21:38,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">speechless nights,</font></font></font></font>

308
00:21:39,650 --> 00:21:43,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">a hint of warmth,</font></font></font></font>

309
00:21:39,690 --> 00:21:43,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitokira no nukumori to</font></font></font></font>

310
00:21:45,400 --> 00:21:50,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">and this distant yearning for you</font></font></font></font>

311
00:21:45,450 --> 00:21:50,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">haruka kanata no akogare to</font></font></font></font>

312
00:21:50,870 --> 00:21:53,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I live,</font></font></font></font>

313
00:21:50,910 --> 00:21:53,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">tada sore dake wo</font></font></font></font>

314
00:21:53,700 --> 00:21:59,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">simply repeating this cycle</font></font></font></font>

315
00:21:53,750 --> 00:21:59,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kurikaeshi boku wa ikite iru</font></font></font></font>

316
00:22:01,840 --> 00:22:08,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">held in my two hands</font></font></font></font>

317
00:22:01,880 --> 00:22:08,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kono ryoute ni kakaete iru mono</font></font></font></font>

318
00:22:08,720 --> 00:22:11,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">a droplet of time</font></font></font></font>

319
00:22:08,760 --> 00:22:11,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">toki no shizuku</font></font></font></font>

320
00:22:12,760 --> 00:22:19,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">softly clutching forgotten memories</font></font></font></font>

321
00:22:12,810 --> 00:22:19,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">sotto nigirishimete wasureta kioku</font></font></font></font>

322
00:22:19,100 --> 00:22:22,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">lost words</font></font></font></font>

323
00:22:19,150 --> 00:22:22,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">nakushita kotoba</font></font></font></font>

324
00:22:30,870 --> 00:22:34,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I'll keep these thoughts...</font></font></font></font>

325
00:22:30,910 --> 00:22:34,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kono omoi wa</font></font></font></font>

326
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:42,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Give me all you've got, Naruto.</font>

327
00:22:42,750 --> 00:22:46,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Or is this all you've got?</font>

328
00:22:46,800 --> 00:22:50,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You were talking impudently
about your Ninja Way</font>

329
00:22:50,140 --> 00:22:53,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">and this is all you've got?</font>

330
00:22:54,140 --> 00:22:59,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You've gotta be kidding! Right now,
you're not even worth beating!</font>

331
00:23:00,020 --> 00:23:03,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Father and Son. The Cracked Family Crest."</font>

